      "start_seconds": 200.0,
      "end_seconds": 209.42,
      "duration_seconds": 9.42,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 110 over 69, oxygen saturation is 99 percent, pulse is 69 beats a minute. And temp 36.6 degrees."
