      "start_seconds": 274.21,
      "end_seconds": 289.35,
      "duration_seconds": 15.14,
      "text": "right, here's what I'm thinking i'm honestly not certain yet it could be perimenopausal symptoms, or it might be anaemia. Blood tests is what I'd like next, for hot flushes"
