      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.66,
      "end_seconds": 317.35,
      "duration_seconds": 23.69,
      "text": "layers of clothing, a fan by the bed, and cutting down on caffeine and spicy food can help the flushes make sure you're drinking plenty of fluids, two to three litres a day if you can, and get proper rest i'll want another look in three months"
